---
// AboutCredits.astro - Credits & About Section for GDGoC Study Jam
---

<div class="about-credits-container not-content">
  <div class="credits-header">
    <div class="credits-pill">
      <span>Kolaborator & Penyelenggara</span>
    </div>
    <h3 class="credits-title">Tentang Program & Tim Pembuat</h3>
    <p class="credits-subtitle">
      Study Jam Mobile Development diselenggarakan oleh <strong>Google Developer Groups On Campus Universitas Widyatama</strong> untuk membimbing mahasiswa belajar Android modern dari nol.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="credits-cards-grid">
    <!-- Lead Instructor & Creator -->
    <div class="credit-card">
      <div class="credit-badge">Instructor</div>
      <a href="https://github.com/pavelc4" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="credit-avatar-link">
        <img
          src="https://github.com/pavelc4.png"
          alt="Dimas Dwi Ariyanto"
          class="credit-avatar-img"
          width="52"
          height="52"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </a>
      <h4>Dimas Dwi Ariyanto</h4>
      <span class="credit-role">Instructor & Tech Division</span>
      <p>
        Just an ordinary student.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- GDGoC Tech Team -->
    <div class="credit-card">
      <div class="credit-badge">Technical Division</div>
      <a href="https://github.com/gdgocwidyatama" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="credit-avatar-link">
        <img
          src="https://github.com/gdgocwidyatama.png"
          alt="GDGoC Tech Team"
          class="credit-avatar-img"
          width="52"
          height="52"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </a>
      <h4>GDGoC Tech Team</h4>
      <span class="credit-role">Core Team</span>
      <p>
        Best team ever.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- GDGoC Core Team & Campus Chapter -->
    <div class="credit-card">
      <div class="credit-badge">Host & Community</div>
      <a href="https://github.com/gdgocwidyatama" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="credit-avatar-link">
        <img
          src="https://github.com/gdgocwidyatama.png"
          alt="GDGoC Widyatama"
          class="credit-avatar-img"
          width="52"
          height="52"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </a>
      <h4>GDGoC Widyatama</h4>
      <span class="credit-role">Universitas Widyatama Chapter</span>
      <p>
        Komunitas teknologi pengembang Google di Universitas Widyatama (Bandung, Jawa Barat) yang memfasilitasi ruang belajar, kolaborasi, dan networking industri.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Community Links Row -->
  <div class="community-links-card">
    <div class="community-info">
      <strong>Terhubung dengan Komunitas Kami</strong>
      <span>Ikuti kanal resmi GDGoC Universitas Widyatama untuk informasi workshop, study jam, dan event mendatang.</span>
    </div>
    <div class="community-buttons">
      <a href="https://gdg.community.dev/gdg-on-campus-widyatama-university-bandung-indonesia/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="comm-btn">
        <svg class="comm-icon" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
          <path d="M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.48 10 10 10 10-4.48 10-10S17.52 2 12 2zm-1 17.93c-3.95-.49-7-3.85-7-7.93 0-.62.08-1.21.21-1.79L9 15v1c0 1.1.9 2 2 2v1.93zm6.9-2.54c-.26-.81-1-1.39-1.9-1.39h-1v-3c0-.55-.45-1-1-1H8v-2h2c.55 0 1-.45 1-1V7h2c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2v-.41c2.93 1.19 5 4.06 5 7.41 0 2.08-.8 3.97-2.1 5.39z"/>
        </svg>
        <span>GDG Chapter</span>
      </a>
      <a href="https://github.com/gdgocwidyatama" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="comm-btn">
        <svg class="comm-icon" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
